WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.536
Oh no!

2
00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:07.090
The little orbs want a bedtime story, and Maya is too tired to read out loud!

3
00:00:07.845 --> 00:00:11.112
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:14.026
This is Episode 90.

5
00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.679
Meet the singing bell.

6
00:00:17.434 --> 00:00:21.656
Slide a card under it, and the bell reads it out loud in a warm voice.

7
00:00:22.412 --> 00:00:24.370
Want a different voice?

8
00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:27.059
Slide another card.

9
00:00:27.814 --> 00:00:29.535
Soft and low.

10
00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.918
Bright and high.

11
00:00:32.674 --> 00:00:35.315
Tap once, and it reads slower.

12
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:38.334
Tap twice, faster.

13
00:00:39.089 --> 00:00:43.523
Stack up a hundred cards, and it reads them all without ever getting tired.

14
00:00:44.278 --> 00:00:46.472
That is Amazon Polly.

15
00:00:47.227 --> 00:00:50.481
It turns written words into a real speaking voice.

16
00:00:51.237 --> 00:00:53.360
Now you know the singing bell!

17
00:00:54.115 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

